    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: "Skill Points are set to 0 at the start. Every time your character's  level increases, you will be awarded with 1 Skill Point. You can use these Skill Points to learn new skills or upgrade existing skills.\r\nMost skills will require you to consume skill points in order to learn them.\r\nThe starting skills won뭪 require that much skill points, therefore the points will be more than sufficient.\r\nBut later you might not have enough points to learn some skills, think properly, and choose the essential skills to learn."
