  - statementId: 47
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: "Every time your character levels up, you are awarded with 3 Stat Points. The allocation of these Stat Points to the different attributes of your character will determine the growth and build of your character.\nIf you concentrate on Dexterity, you will earn fast attack speed and become a Fast Attack Type.\nDistributing the points evenly to Strength and Dexterity and some to Vitality, will allow your character to become Power Attack Type.\nLastly, distributing the points evenly to Strength and Dexterity and some to Intelligence, will allow your character to become Skill Type."
